<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Petra cautions it in talks.</title>
<headline>Petra cautions it in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petra Mining Ltd said on Wednesday that it was in talks which if successfully concluded may have an effect on the firm's share price on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
